  "comment": "Panel is drawn in code at runtime, so the SVG carries no lettering; the labels here were read from the library screenshot and the drawLayer() text calls. Param 50, input 25 (harmony hold tied notes) and outputs 2, 17, 18 and 19 have no widget and cannot be clicked, so they have no line: the tempo output is never written to and the three trigger outputs are marked 'not used' in the source. The poly scale output has no family because the menu changes it between 1V/octave pitches and a chromatic 8V/10V marker map. Ranges, the note-length divisor tables, the accent, syncopate and shuffle rules and the chord type voltages all came from Meander.cpp; the CV eigenvalues and the progression preset count came from the README."
